      },
      {
        "text": "The criticisms regarding unclear definitions are fair.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "It is challenging to define how one would know in 20 years whether the U.S.-China competition has been won.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
