    "turn_text": "Could you just unpack that a bit more in terms of some of the concerns or feedback you get from members of Asian Americans, members of the AAPI community? I've heard just informally, as the competition with China has heated up over the past three, four, five years, growing concerns from Americans of Asian descent, how do you think about that issue? How do you think about putting in place guardrails that constrain that even as we potentially moving towards a much more um a fractious relationship with China.",
