    "turn_text": "You know, the Chinese, you know this very well. One of their theories of the case, so to speak, about why America is so weak in their view is that we are divided and that we are bigoted. We're prejudiced against each other. And so when we, you know, play to type, so to speak, it just feeds that propaganda machine and they then trot that out around the world. And so we're really hurting ourselves in the process.",
